wire m2.value m3.value
wire n1.result m4.condition
wire m3.then m4.in
wire m5.value m7.a
wire m6.value m7.b
wire m2.value m8.Length
wire m9.value m8.Ptr
wire m8.value n0.collection
wire m5.value n0.index
wire m7.result n1.a
wire n2.result n1.b
wire n0.value n2.a
wire m4.body n3.in
wire n7.result n4.condition
